#, php-format
msgid "Header row with columns: %s. Name a stored credential; never put a password in the file. Every row must be valid or nothing is imported."
msgstr "Umqolo wentloko oneekholam: %s. Xela igama lesiqinisekiso esigciniweyo; ungaze ufake igama lokugqitha efayileni. Wonke umqolo kufuneka usebenze okanye akukho nto ingeniswayo."

