msgstr "I-BMC entsha yeRedfish"

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "Redfish BMC: %s"
msgstr "I-BMC yeRedfish: %s"

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Host name or IP address of the BMC, without https:// or a path."
msgstr "Igama lomamkeli okanye idilesi ye-IP ye-BMC, ngaphandle kwe-https:// okanye indlela."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Do not verify is logged when set and shown as a warning on the health page while it stays."
msgstr "Ungaqinisekisi ilogwa xa isetiwe kwaye iboniswa njengesilumkiso kwiphepha lempilo ngelixa isahleli njalo."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "CA Bundle File"
msgstr "Ifayile ye-CA Bundle"

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "For the CA bundle mode: absolute path on the poller to a PEM file that others cannot write."
msgstr "Kwindlela ye-CA bundle: indlela epheleleyo kwi-poller eya kwifayile ye-PEM engenakubhalwa ngabanye."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "For the pinned mode: base64 SHA-256 of the BMC public key, as sha256//... or the bare hash. A changed key fails until this is updated."
msgstr "Kwindlela eqhotyoshelweyo: i-SHA-256 ye-base64 yeqhosha loluntu le-BMC, njenge-sha256//... okanye i-hash yodwa. Iqhosha elitshintshiweyo liyasilela kude kube lihlaziywa oku."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Public Key Pin"
msgstr "IPhini yeQhosha loLuntu"

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Allow Basic Authentication Fallback"
msgstr "Vumela ukubuyela kuqinisekiso lwe-Basic"

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Used only when the BMC offers no session service. Every request then carries the password; the health page warns while it is in use."
msgstr "Isetyenziswa kuphela xa i-BMC ingaboneleli ngenkonzo yeseshoni. Isicelo ngasinye siye sithwale igama lokugqitha; iphepha lempilo liyalumkisa ngelixa isetyenziswa."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "The Cacti device of the server this BMC manages. Leave it at none to have the plugin create a device from the list."
msgstr "Isixhobo seCacti seseva elawulwa yile BMC. Sishiye ku-'akukho nasinye' ukuze isongezelelo siyile isixhobo kuluhlu."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php lib/CredentialsPage.php
