msgstr "Igama lomsebenzisi"

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
msgid "No credentials yet. Create one with a read-only BMC account."
msgstr "Azikho iziqinisekiso okwangoku. Yila esinye ngeakhawunti ye-BMC yokufunda kuphela."

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
msgid "None stored"
msgstr "Akukho nto igciniweyo"

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
msgid "Stored"
msgstr "Igcinwe"

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d BMCs"
msgstr "%d ii-BMC"

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
msgid "New Redfish Credential"
msgstr "Isiqinisekiso esitsha seRedfish"

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "Redfish Credential: %s"
msgstr "Isiqinisekiso seRedfish: %s"

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
msgid "A BMC account with the ReadOnly role. The plugin never needs a role that can change BMC state."
msgstr "Iakhawunti ye-BMC enendima ye-ReadOnly. Isongezelelo asize sifune indima enokutshintsha imeko ye-BMC."

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
msgid "A password is stored. Leave blank to keep it."
msgstr "Igama lokugqitha ligciniwe. Shiya kungenanto ukuze uligcine."

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
msgid "Stored encrypted with the vault key."
msgstr "Igcinwe yafihlwa ngeqhosha le-vault."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The Redfish templates are not installed completely. Reinstall them from the Redfish BMCs page."
msgstr "Iitempleyithi zeRedfish azifakelwanga ngokupheleleyo. Zifakele kwakhona kwiphepha lee-BMC zeRedfish."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "A device \"%s\" from the %s device template, polled by poller %d, with availability checks off. Its host name is a reserved name that is never contacted."
msgstr "Isixhobo \\\"%s\\\" esivela kwitempleyithi yesixhobo se-%s, esivavanywa yi-poller %d, sinokuhlolwa kokufumaneka okucinyiweyo. Igama laso lomamkeli ligama eligciniweyo elingaze liqhagamshelwane nalo."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "The data query \"%s\", with a graph for each of the %d members known now."
msgstr "Umbuzo wedatha \\\"%s\\\", onegrafu yelungu ngalinye kwamalungu %d aziwayo ngoku."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d fans or power supplies that were present are no longer reported. They count as failed until you confirm; confirming accepts the members the BMC reports now."
msgstr "%d iifeni okanye iziboneleli zamandla ebezikhona azisaxelwa. Zibalwa njengezisileleyo de uqinisekise; ukuqinisekisa kwamkela amalungu axelwa yi-BMC ngoku."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "The graph \"%s\", with its \"%s\" data source."
msgstr "Igrafu \\\"%s\\\", kunye nomthombo wayo wedatha \\\"%s\\\"."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The BMC is already mapped to a device."
msgstr "I-BMC sele imaphwe kwisixhobo."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "Created by the Redfish plugin for BMC %s. Its values come from the plugin cache; the host name is a reserved name that is never contacted."
msgstr "Iyilwe sisongezelelo seRedfish se-BMC %s. Amaxabiso ayo avela kwi-cache yesongezelelo; igama lomamkeli ligama eligciniweyo elingaze liqhagamshelwane nalo."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "Cacti refused to create the device. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "ICacti yalile ukuyila isixhobo. Jonga ilogi yeCacti."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The new device would be hidden from you by your device permissions, so it was removed again. Ask an administrator to grant access, or map the BMC to a device you can see."
msgstr "Isixhobo esitsha besiya kufihlwa kuwe ziimvume zakho zesixhobo, ngoko ke sisusiwe kwakhona. Cela umlawuli ukuba akunike ufikelelo, okanye umaphishe i-BMC kwisixhobo onokusibona."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The BMC was mapped to a device by someone else meanwhile, or could not be mapped, so the new device was removed again. Reload the page and check its mapping."
msgstr "I-BMC imaphwe kwisixhobo ngomnye umntu okwangoku, okanye ayikwazanga ukumaphwa, ngoko ke isixhobo esitsha sisusiwe kwakhona. Layisha kwakhona iphepha kwaye ukhangele ukumaphwa kwayo."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Redfish templates could not be installed: %s"
msgstr "Iitempleyithi zeRedfish azikwazanga ukufakelwa: %s"

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
msgid "The Redfish templates are not installed or not current. Reinstall them from the Redfish BMCs page."
msgstr "Iitempleyithi zeRedfish azifakelwanga okanye azikho ngoku. Zifakele kwakhona kwiphepha lee-BMC zeRedfish."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: its Cacti device was deleted. Map it to another device or create one from the BMCs page."
msgstr "%s: isixhobo sayo seCacti sicinyiwe. Yimaphe kwesinye isixhobo okanye yila esinye kwiphepha lee-BMC."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: its device is polled by poller %d but the BMC is read by poller %d. Move one of them so both use the same poller, or its graphs can read as unknown."
msgstr "%s: isixhobo sayo sivavanywa yi-poller %d kodwa i-BMC ifundwa yi-poller %d. Shenxisa esinye sazo ukuze zombini zisebenzise i-poller efanayo, okanye iigrafu zayo zinokufundwa njengezingaziwayo."

#: lib/GraphLinks.php
msgid "Redfish graphs of this device"
msgstr "Iigrafu zeRedfish zesi sixhobo"

