#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Credential Vault"
msgstr "Ivolt yeziQinisekiso"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Vault Key File"
msgstr "Ifayile yesiTshixo seVolt"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the 32-byte key that encrypts stored BMC passwords. Create it yourself, outside the web root, readable only by the web server and poller user, in a directory that only root and that user can write; the plugin never creates or writes it. Back it up with the database: without it, stored passwords must be entered again."
msgstr "Indlela epheleleyo eya kwiqhosha eliyi-32-byte elifihla amagama okugqitha e-BMC agciniweyo. Ziyilele yona ngokwakho, ngaphandle kwe-web root, ifundeke kuphela yiseva yewebhu nomsebenzisi we-poller, kulawulo olunokubhalwa kuphela ngu-root naloo msebenzisi; isongezelelo asize siyiyile okanye siyibhale. Yenzele ikopi yokhuseleko kunye nedathabheyisi: ngaphandle kwayo, amagama okugqitha agciniweyo kufuneka afakwe kwakhona."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector"
msgstr "Umqokeleli"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection Interval"
msgstr "Ithuba lokuQokelela"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds between reads of each BMC."
msgstr "Imizuzwana phakathi kokufundwa kwe-BMC nganye."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Rediscovery Interval"
msgstr "Isithuba sokufumanisa kwakhona"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds between full resource discoveries of each BMC. A BMC is also rediscovered at once when a known resource disappears or changes type."
msgstr "Imizuzwana phakathi kokufunyaniswa okupheleleyo kwezibonelelo ze-BMC nganye. I-BMC ikwafunyaniswa kwakhona ngoko nangoko xa isibonelelo esaziwayo sinyamalala okanye sitshintsha uhlobo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Time Budget"
msgstr "Uhlahlo-lwabiwo lweXesha loMqokeleli"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one collector run may spend before it stops starting new BMCs. Keep it below the poller interval; unfinished BMCs resume on the next run."
msgstr "Imizuzwana enokusetyenziswa lusebenzo olunye lomqokeleli phambi kokuba luyeke ukuqalisa ii-BMC ezitsha. Yigcine ingaphantsi kwesithuba se-poller; ii-BMC ezingagqitywanga ziyaqhubeka kusebenzo olulandelayo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "BMCs read in parallel. Each BMC is read by one worker at a time."
msgstr "Ii-BMC zifundwa ngaxeshanye. I-BMC nganye ifundwa ngumsebenzi omnye ngexesha."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Workers"
msgstr "Abasebenzi bomqokeleli"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Umda Wexesha Lokudibanisa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds allowed for the TCP connection and TLS handshake to a BMC."
msgstr "Imizuzwana evumelekileyo yoqhagamshelo lwe-TCP kunye ne-TLS handshake eya kwi-BMC."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Request Timeout"
msgstr "Ixesha eliphelelweyo lesicelo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds allowed for one whole request to a BMC, including the connection."
msgstr "Imizuzwana evumelekileyo yesicelo esinye esipheleleyo kwi-BMC, kuquka uqhagamshelo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB accepted in one BMC response body; a larger response is refused."
msgstr "Ii-KiB ezamkelekileyo kumzimba omnye wempendulo ye-BMC; impendulo enkulu kunoko iyaliwa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Response Size"
msgstr "Ubungakanani obuphezulu bempendulo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Freshness"
msgstr "Ubutsha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection intervals after which a reading is shown as delayed."
msgstr "Izithuba zokuqokelela emva kwazo ufundiso luboniswa njengolulibazisekileyo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Delayed After"
msgstr "Ilibaziseke emva kwe"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection intervals after which a reading is stale and reads as unknown. Always at least one more than Delayed After."
msgstr "Izithuba zokuqokelela emva kwazo ufundiso luba lundala kwaye lufundwa njengolungaziwayo. Soloko lungaphezulu ngesinye kunoko kubekwe ku-Ilibaziseke emva kwe."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Stale After"
msgstr "Iphelelwa Emva"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Khupha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Gcina iiTheyibhile ze-Plugin xa uKhupha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its BMC registry, encrypted passwords, and reading cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them. Uninstall never touches Cacti devices, graphs, or BMCs, including devices the plugin created."
msgstr "Xa ikhethiwe, ukukhupha isongezelelo kugcina irejistri yaso ye-BMC, amagama okugqitha afihliweyo, kunye ne-cache yofundo. Yisuse ukuze ukukhupha kuzilahle. Ukukhupha akuze kuchukumise izixhobo zeCacti, iigrafu, okanye ii-BMC, kuquka nezixhobo eziyilwe sisongezelelo."

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Verify against the system CA store"
msgstr "Qinisekisa ngokuchasene nevenkile ye-CA yesistim"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Verify against a CA bundle file"
msgstr "Qinisekisa ngokuchasene nefayile ye-CA bundle"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Pinned public key (SHA-256)"
msgstr "Iqhosha loluntu eliqhotyoshelweyo (SHA-256)"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Do not verify (unsafe)"
msgstr "Ungaqinisekisi (akukhuselekanga)"

