#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The BMC and its cached data were deleted. Its Cacti device was left in place."
msgstr "I-BMC kunye nedatha yayo ekwi-cache zicinyiwe. Isixhobo sayo seCacti sishiywe endaweni yaso."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "Backoff and held failures were cleared; the collector reads the BMC on its next run."
msgstr "Ukulinda nokusilela okubanjwe ngaphambili kucinyiwe; umqokeleli ufunda i-BMC kusebenzo lwakhe olulandelayo."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "Adding devices and graphs needs Cacti's device management permission."
msgstr "Ukongeza izixhobo neegrafu kufuna imvume yolawulo lwezixhobo yeCacti."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The device of this BMC was deleted. Choose another device, or none, on the BMC form first."
msgstr "Isixhobo sale BMC sicinyiwe. Khetha esinye isixhobo, okanye akukho nasinye, kwifom ye-BMC kuqala."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
#, php-format
